	"Name": "Giant Ghostshroom Trees",
	"Author": "Mushroomed",
	"Description": "[size=4][b][font=Verdana][center][/center][/font][/b][/size][center][font=Verdana][size=5][b]\uFEFFGiant Ghostshroom Trees[/b][/size][/font][/center][size=2][font=Arial][center][color=#f4f4f4]Requires\u00A0[/color][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915][b][i][color=#ea9999]Content Patcher![/color][/i][/b][/url][/center][/font][font=Arial]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[/font][/size][left][/left][size=2][font=Arial]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFFThese giant\u00A0ghostly shrooms have been a very difficult project!\n<br />Originally made for\u00A0Json Assets, quite a while ago, I had to rewrite them for Content Patcher after Json Assets became deprecated, and because I wanted it done in a very specific way, it ended up harder for me to figure out. But, here they are, tested for some time and ready to be shared.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ea9999]All separated into their own working independently, mod folders.[/color][/b]\n<br />For convenience to pick which colors to keep, or maybe if you just want one of them. All color variants can be used together and alone. Simply delete the folders with the colors you don't like.\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ea9999]Overall, there are sixteen colors.[/color][/b]\n<br />I had some difficulty getting the colors to look the way I would have liked, my laptop screen has been a little off with saturation and brightness, so I might revisit and recolor some of them, sometime in the future, if I can.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ea9999]Bought at Dwarf's shop![/color][/b]\n<br />[color=#f4f4f4]No conditions to unlock, the saplings are always available to buy.[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ea9999]The trees produce little Ghostshrooms in fall, on their caps.[/color][/b]\n<br />The\u00A0Ghostshrooms\u00A0are edible, they can't be put into seedmaker and the trees can't be tapped, I haven't figured out how to make that happen, quite yet!\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b]Credits:[/b]\n<br />Original textures taken as base made by\u00A0Sevarihk.\u00A0Found\u00A0[url=https://sevarihk.itch.io/dead-swamp-tileset][b][i][color=#ea9999]here![/color][/i][/b][/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[/font][font=Arial]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b]Permissions:[/b]\n<br />Edit for personal use is okay, but please don't redistribute, thank you.\u00A0[url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/Mushroomed/about-me][b][i][color=#ea9999]See my full permissions on my profile page, here![/color][/i][/b][/url][url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/Mushroomed/about-me][b][color=#d5a6bd]\n<br />[/color][color=#f4f4f4]\n<br />\n<br />[/color][/b][/url][/font][/size]",
